OL,3,GNEWSAFour murder arrests after
OL,4,Ateenagers attacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man died
OL,8,Fand another suffered life-threatening
OL,9,Finjuries in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,11,FA cordon remains in place on Brookhouse
OL,12,FRoad, in Meir, after police were called
OL,13,Fto reports of violence at 23:45 BST on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FA man in his late teens was confirmed
OL,17,Fdead at the scene, Staffordshire Police
OL,18,Fsaid, and another man, also in his late
OL,19,Fteens, was taken to hospital, where he
OL,20,Fremains in a critical but stable
OL,21,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
